  "title": "A covered call is one trade with two legs",
  "summary": "Covered call income is not free premium. It is payment for selling your upside and keeping linear downside risk on the stock. Judge a covered call by the combined P&L of the stock and the short call. Anyone who only reports the call income is not telling the whole story.",
